* Alternative structure: self-cascode (composite) tail current source and bias
* diode. Each is two stacked NMOS sharing the ibias gate (L = 1 um at the rail,
* L = 0.5 um above it), raising the tail's output resistance without a cascode
* bias line; NMOS pair and PMOS mirror load as in the reference.
.subckt ota_5t vss ibias vdd vinn vinp vout
XINP nleft vinp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=90 nf=10
XINN vout vinn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=90 nf=10
XLD nleft nleft vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=100 nf=20
XLO vout nleft vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=100 nf=20
XTB t1 ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=200 nf=20
XTT tail ibias t1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=400 nf=40
XBB b1 ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=60 nf=6
XBT ibias ibias b1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=120 nf=12
.ends ota_5t
